Seen live on the karr dzil build against rootless Podman 5.4.2: the build failed and the #12 replay logged nothing. _extract_build_lines keeps only ^Step \d+/\d+ \s*: (docker legacy) and BuildKit #N headers; Podman's classic builder emits 'STEP 1/8: FROM ...' (uppercase, colon directly attached), so concise mode drops every line - on success and on the failed-build replay alike. Verify against a real podman stream, then widen the match.

